It reads the F1ATB and MSunPV solar routers of the user's own local network
through the pages their own web interface uses. This integration is not
affiliated with nor endorsed by F1ATB nor Ard-Tek; F1ATB, MSunPV and Ard-Tek
are names of their owners.

The F1ATB pages and fields (/ajax_data, /ajax_etatActions, /ajax_dataESP32,
/ForceAction) follow the published sources of the router firmware
(https://github.com/F1ATB/Solar-Router-F1ATB, no license declared), read for
the facts only: no code is taken from them.

The MSunPV fields (/status.xml, POST /index.xml) follow those documented by
the Home Assistant integration https://github.com/pvergezac/MSunPVIntegration
(MIT), read for the facts only: no code is taken from it.
